Modified by Organic: resized; unobserved map gaps filled for display;\par
projected and lit. The observed heart region is retained.\par
\par
Pallas, Juno, Vesta, Astraea, Hygiea, Chiron, Pholus, Nessus, Orcus, Quaoar,\par
Makemake, Gonggong, and Sedna use procedural surface illustrations created\par
for Organic from the approved PlanetBodies board recipes.\par
